<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net" agent="Cursor" pages="5">
  <diagram name="1 - Context" id="dl_p1">
    <mxGraphModel grid="0" page="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1700" pageHeight="1000" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="p1_title" parent="1" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=#D79B00;fontColor=#FFFFFF;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;" value="datalab — Config-Driven Medallion Framework  ·  ONE YAML artifact per table → Lakeflow SDP" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="44" width="1620" x="40" y="20" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p1_sub" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=13;fontStyle=2;" value="A medallion (bronze → silver → gold) lakehouse framework where the target table IS the unit of work. Author its YAML artifact; the framework generates the pyspark.pipelines datasets, the dqx quality gates, and the AUTO CDC flows. Ships as a Declarative Automation Bundle deployed by GitHub OIDC CI/CD." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="40" width="1620" x="40" y="70" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p1_today" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#DAE8FC;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;strokeWidth=2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=12;spacingRight=14;fontSize=12;arcSize=6;" value="&lt;b style=&#39;font-size:14px;&#39;&gt;WHAT EXISTS TODAY&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Framework &lt;tt&gt;src/datalab/&lt;/tt&gt; — reusable, zero domain code&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• One worked domain &lt;tt&gt;projects/customer_sales/&lt;/tt&gt;: bronze → silver (AUTO CDC SCD1) → gold, dqx valid/quarantine, edge jobs + notebook&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Three authoring lanes: SDP pipelines, python-file jobs, notebooks&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Three execution profiles: Databricks, OSS spark-pipelines, Databricks Connect&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Deploy: DAB → GitHub OIDC → dev / stage / prod" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="330" width="510" x="40" y="125" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p1_goals" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#82B366;strokeWidth=2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=12;spacingRight=14;fontSize=12;arcSize=3;" value="&lt;b style=&#39;font-size:14px;&#39;&gt;DESIGN GOALS&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• A target table = &lt;b&gt;ONE artifact&lt;/b&gt; (columns, dqx rules, CDC target) authored from natural language&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Framework vs domain&lt;/b&gt; strict separation — the framework lifts into any project untouched&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Single-writer invariant&lt;/b&gt; — every UC table has exactly one owning lane&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Config validated by Pydantic + dqx — the SAME loader in CI, pytest, and the pipeline&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• No hand-written &lt;tt&gt;dp.*&lt;/tt&gt; / MERGE unless the capability matrix says the framework cannot express it" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="330" width="510" x="595" y="125" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p1_drivers" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F8CECC;strokeColor=#B85450;strokeWidth=2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=12;spacingRight=14;fontSize=12;arcSize=4;" value="&lt;b style=&#39;font-size:14px;&#39;&gt;WHY (DRIVERS)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Config-driven beats hand-written pipelines — reviewable, statically validated, uniform across tables&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Data quality as &lt;b&gt;evidence&lt;/b&gt; — dqx valid/quarantine split with _errors structs&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Run anywhere&lt;/b&gt; — local OSS for a fast inner loop, Connect for live validation, Databricks for prod&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Reproducible deps — uv end to end (&lt;tt&gt;uv.lock&lt;/tt&gt;, CI &lt;tt&gt;--frozen&lt;/tt&gt;)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Agents author tables safely behind protected-file + branch-first guards" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="330" width="510" x="1150" y="125" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p1_detail" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFE6CC;strokeColor=#D79B00;strokeWidth=3;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=12;spacingRight=14;fontSize=12;arcSize=5;" value="&lt;b style=&#39;font-size:15px;color:#7F4F00;&#39;&gt;THE FLOWSPEC PATTERN  ·  config/&amp;lt;catalog&amp;gt;/&amp;lt;schema&amp;gt;/&amp;lt;table&amp;gt;.yml is the source of truth&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Every target table is declared by ONE YAML artifact (file name == table name; folder path mirrors the UC namespace &lt;tt&gt;&amp;lt;catalog&amp;gt;.&amp;lt;schema&amp;gt;.&amp;lt;table&amp;gt;&lt;/tt&gt;). The artifact declares:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;→ &lt;b&gt;source(s)&lt;/b&gt; — cloud_files / files / table / view / kafka (single &lt;tt&gt;source:&lt;/tt&gt; or fan-in &lt;tt&gt;sources:&lt;/tt&gt;)&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;→ &lt;b&gt;columns&lt;/b&gt; — source→target names, data types (always &lt;tt&gt;try_cast&lt;/tt&gt;), per-column dqx rules&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;→ &lt;b&gt;transform&lt;/b&gt; steps (registry names) + table-level &lt;b&gt;quality&lt;/b&gt; checks&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;→ optional &lt;b&gt;backfill:&lt;/b&gt; once-flows (the recreation path + audit trail)&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;→ &lt;b&gt;target&lt;/b&gt; kind — streaming_table [+cdc | +cdc_from_snapshot] / materialized_view / temporary_view / delta_sink / kafka_sink&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;datalab.framework.generate&lt;/b&gt; turns the validated config into Lakeflow SDP datasets. Business logic lives in &lt;tt&gt;src/&amp;lt;catalog&amp;gt;_etl/transforms/&lt;/tt&gt; as pure &lt;tt&gt;@transform&lt;/tt&gt; functions; custom dqx in &lt;tt&gt;checks/&lt;/tt&gt;. The per-domain &lt;tt&gt;transformations/pipeline.py&lt;/tt&gt; is 3 lines. &lt;b&gt;Never &lt;tt&gt;import dlt&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/b&gt; — this repo standardizes on &lt;tt&gt;pyspark.pipelines&lt;/tt&gt;." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="350" width="1620" x="40" y="475" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p1_struct" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;strokeWidth=2;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=16;spacingRight=16;fontSize=12;" value="&lt;b style=&#39;font-size:13px;&#39;&gt;How this file is structured&lt;/b&gt; — Pages 2-5 walk the flow:&amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;AUTHOR&lt;/b&gt; (Page 2: artifact anatomy + the 3-question lane router) &amp;nbsp;→&amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;GENERATE&lt;/b&gt; (Page 3: YAML → pyspark.pipelines datasets) &amp;nbsp;→&amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;RUN&lt;/b&gt; (Page 4: medallion runtime + the three execution profiles) &amp;nbsp;→&amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;SHIP&lt;/b&gt; (Page 5: bundle deploy + RBAC / ABAC governance)." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="80" width="1620" x="40" y="845" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p1_footer" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#7F4F00;" value="The artifact is the contract. Author it; the framework owns materialization. Full reference + SDP capability matrix: docs/FRAMEWORK.md.  The implemented system is mapped in design/02_implementation_end_to_end.drawio." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="1620" x="40" y="940" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
  <diagram name="2 - AUTHOR - Artifact + lane router" id="dl_p2">
    <mxGraphModel grid="0" page="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1700" pageHeight="1000" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="p2_title" parent="1" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=#D79B00;fontColor=#FFFFFF;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;fontSize=18;fontStyle=1;" value="STAGE 1 of 4  —  AUTHOR  ·  The YAML artifact anatomy + the 3-question lane router" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="40" width="1620" x="40" y="20" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p2_sub" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fontStyle=2;" value="Adding or changing a table = authoring its artifact, not writing Python. Use the author-ldp-artifact skill to turn a natural-language request into the YAML below. Route every new target through the 3-question router first." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="34" width="1620" x="40" y="65" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p2_art_hdr" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#1F4E79;strokeColor=#1F4E79;fontColor=#FFFFFF;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=14;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;" value="A  ·  Artifact anatomy  —  config/&amp;lt;catalog&amp;gt;/&amp;lt;schema&amp;gt;/&amp;lt;table&amp;gt;.yml  (one file == one target table)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="32" width="1040" x="40" y="115" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p2_art" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFE6CC;strokeColor=#D79B00;strokeWidth=2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=12;spacingRight=14;fontSize=12;arcSize=2;" value="&lt;b&gt;source:&lt;/b&gt; / &lt;b&gt;sources:&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; one input or a fan-in list (replaces UNION).&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;kinds: &lt;tt&gt;cloud_files&lt;/tt&gt; (Auto Loader) · &lt;tt&gt;files&lt;/tt&gt; · &lt;tt&gt;table&lt;/tt&gt; · &lt;tt&gt;view&lt;/tt&gt; · &lt;tt&gt;kafka&lt;/tt&gt;. Each flow has a name — &lt;i&gt;flow names are streaming-checkpoint identities&lt;/i&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;columns:&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; the source→target mapping. &lt;tt&gt;name&lt;/tt&gt; / &lt;tt&gt;source&lt;/tt&gt; / &lt;tt&gt;type&lt;/tt&gt; (cast with &lt;tt&gt;try_cast&lt;/tt&gt; so ANSI-mode bad values become NULL, not a stream failure) + per-column &lt;b&gt;quality:&lt;/b&gt; dqx rules.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;transform:&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; ordered step list referencing &lt;tt&gt;@transform&lt;/tt&gt;-registered pure functions in the domain package.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;quality:&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; table-level dqx checks (dqx metadata format). One rules list drives BOTH the target filter and the &lt;tt&gt;&amp;lt;table&amp;gt;_quarantine&lt;/tt&gt; split.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;backfill:&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; optional once-flows (batch source; streaming when the target has &lt;tt&gt;cdc:&lt;/tt&gt;). They re-run on full refresh by design.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;target:&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; the kind + its options (see C below) — &lt;tt&gt;cdc&lt;/tt&gt; / &lt;tt&gt;cdc_from_snapshot&lt;/tt&gt; keys, sequence_by, SCD type." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="560" width="1040" x="40" y="150" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p2_router_hdr" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#82B366;strokeColor=#82B366;fontColor=#FFFFFF;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=14;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;" value="B  ·  Route every new target — the 3-question router" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="32" width="560" x="1100" y="115" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p2_router" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#82B366;strokeWidth=2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=12;spacingRight=14;fontSize=11;arcSize=3;" value="&lt;b&gt;1.&lt;/b&gt; Is the output a managed Delta table in the medallion, derivable from upstream datasets?&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;→ &lt;b&gt;SDP&lt;/b&gt; (mandatory). Backfills included as &lt;tt&gt;backfill:&lt;/tt&gt; once-flows.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;2.&lt;/b&gt; Is it a side-effectful action (export to a volume / external system, API pull into landing, non-SDP table maintenance) running headless on a schedule?&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;→ &lt;b&gt;python-file&lt;/b&gt; (&lt;tt&gt;spark_python_task&lt;/tt&gt;, &lt;tt&gt;src/jobs/&lt;/tt&gt;).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;3.&lt;/b&gt; Must a human read the run output and decide?&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;→ &lt;b&gt;notebook&lt;/b&gt; (&lt;tt&gt;notebook_task&lt;/tt&gt;, on-demand only — no trigger).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;When in doubt: SDP. Exploration with no managed target stays out of the bundle.&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="300" width="560" x="1100" y="150" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p2_inv" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F8CECC;strokeColor=#B85450;strokeWidth=2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=12;spacingRight=14;fontSize=11;arcSize=4;" value="&lt;b style=&#39;color:#822B25;&#39;&gt;Single-writer invariant + don&#39;ts&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Every UC table has exactly ONE owning lane. Jobs and notebooks may READ SDP-owned tables, never WRITE them — a &lt;tt&gt;.saveAsTable&lt;/tt&gt; on an SDP streaming table corrupts pipeline state.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Repaired / backfill data re-enters via the landing volume or a &lt;tt&gt;backfill:&lt;/tt&gt; flow — never a job write.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• No &lt;tt&gt;import dlt&lt;/tt&gt;, no hand-written MERGE, no hardcoded catalogs/paths (use pipeline &lt;tt&gt;configuration&lt;/tt&gt; + &lt;tt&gt;pipeline_conf&lt;/tt&gt;)." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="245" width="560" x="1100" y="465" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p2_targets_hdr" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#D79B00;strokeColor=#D79B00;fontColor=#FFFFFF;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=14;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;" value="C  ·  Target kinds (the YAML target: block) — the SDP surface the framework can express" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="32" width="1620" x="40" y="730" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p2_targets" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFE6CC;strokeColor=#D79B00;strokeWidth=2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=14;fontSize=11;arcSize=2;" value="&lt;b&gt;streaming_table&lt;/b&gt; — &lt;tt&gt;@dp.table&lt;/tt&gt;, append/streaming ingest (Auto Loader, Kafka).&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;streaming_table + cdc&lt;/b&gt; — &lt;tt&gt;create_streaming_table&lt;/tt&gt; + &lt;tt&gt;create_auto_cdc_flow&lt;/tt&gt; (keys + sequence_by; SCD1/SCD2) — replaces MERGE.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;streaming_table + cdc_from_snapshot&lt;/b&gt; — &lt;tt&gt;create_auto_cdc_from_snapshot_flow&lt;/tt&gt; for periodic FULL dumps (nightly extracts).&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;materialized_view&lt;/b&gt; — &lt;tt&gt;@dp.materialized_view&lt;/tt&gt; (gold aggregates, batch).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;temporary_view&lt;/b&gt; — &lt;tt&gt;@dp.temporary_view&lt;/tt&gt; (pipeline-scoped).&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;delta_sink&lt;/b&gt; / &lt;b&gt;kafka_sink&lt;/b&gt; — streaming publish (append-only; never cleared by full refresh, so &lt;tt&gt;backfill:&lt;/tt&gt; is rejected on sinks).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Anything the matrix says is genuinely out of scope (e.g. Kinesis / Pub/Sub sources) is the rare case for the author-sdp-pipeline skill — extend the framework first.&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="160" width="1620" x="40" y="766" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p2_footer" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#7F4F00;" value="Author the artifact, add any new @transform with a unit test, then: make validate-configs lint test validate. Verify interactively with run_dataset / make validate-connect — no deploy needed." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="1620" x="40" y="940" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
  <diagram name="3 - GENERATE - YAML to SDP" id="dl_p3">
    <mxGraphModel grid="0" page="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1700" pageHeight="920" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="p3_title" parent="1" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=#5D3879;fontColor=#FFFFFF;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;fontSize=18;fontStyle=1;" value="STAGE 2 of 4  —  GENERATE  ·  datalab.framework turns the YAML into pyspark.pipelines datasets" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="40" width="1620" x="40" y="20" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p3_sub" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fontStyle=2;" value="The same loader runs in CI, pytest (local Spark) and the deployed pipeline. Dataset functions RETURN a DataFrame — the engine owns materialization (no .write / .saveAsTable / .start / .collect inside them)." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="34" width="1620" x="40" y="65" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p3_models" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E1D5E7;strokeColor=#9673A6;strokeWidth=2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=8;fontSize=11;arcSize=4;" value="&lt;b&gt;1 · models.py&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Pydantic config contract.&lt;br&gt;Parses + validates every artifact (and domain.yml).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;make validate-configs fails fast on a bad rule or type.&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="190" width="300" x="40" y="160" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p3_loader" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E1D5E7;strokeColor=#9673A6;strokeWidth=2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=8;fontSize=11;arcSize=4;" value="&lt;b&gt;2 · loader.py + registry&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Reads domain.yml imports; resolves &lt;tt&gt;@transform&lt;/tt&gt; / &lt;tt&gt;@check_function&lt;/tt&gt; / &lt;tt&gt;@snapshot_source&lt;/tt&gt; by name.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Framework hardcodes no domain module.&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="190" width="300" x="360" y="160" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p3_gen" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E1D5E7;strokeColor=#9673A6;strokeWidth=3;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=8;fontSize=11;arcSize=4;" value="&lt;b&gt;3 · generator.generate()&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Builds the graph: readers → column map (try_cast) → transform steps → dqx → target.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Routes on &lt;tt&gt;datalab.profile&lt;/tt&gt; (see box at right)." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="190" width="300" x="680" y="160" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p3_datasets" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#82B366;strokeWidth=2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=8;fontSize=11;arcSize=4;" value="&lt;b&gt;4 · SDP datasets&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;tt&gt;@dp.table&lt;/tt&gt; (streaming)&lt;br&gt;&lt;tt&gt;@dp.materialized_view&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;tt&gt;create_streaming_table&lt;/tt&gt; + &lt;tt&gt;create_auto_cdc_flow&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Functions return a DataFrame.&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="190" width="300" x="1000" y="160" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p3_profile" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#D1ECF1;strokeColor=#117A8B;strokeWidth=2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=8;fontSize=11;arcSize=4;" value="&lt;b&gt;Profile routing&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;tt&gt;datalab.profile&lt;/tt&gt;:&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;databricks&lt;/b&gt; → dp.* datasets (default)&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;local&lt;/b&gt; → batch materialized views (framework/local.py)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;tt&gt;compat.py&lt;/tt&gt; guards Databricks-only knobs locally." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="190" width="300" x="1320" y="160" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p3_dq_hdr" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#B85450;strokeColor=#B85450;fontColor=#FFFFFF;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=14;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;" value="dqx data quality  —  ONE rules list drives valid + quarantine (dp.expect_* is retired here)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="32" width="1620" x="40" y="400" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p3_dq" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F8CECC;strokeColor=#B85450;strokeWidth=2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=14;fontSize=11;arcSize=2;" value="&lt;b&gt;framework/dq.py&lt;/b&gt; routes the artifact&#39;s &lt;tt&gt;quality.checks&lt;/tt&gt; through databrickslabs/dqx.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;criticality: error&lt;/b&gt; rows are dropped from the target and land in &lt;tt&gt;&amp;lt;dataset&amp;gt;_quarantine&lt;/tt&gt; with &lt;tt&gt;_errors&lt;/tt&gt; evidence structs; &lt;b&gt;warn&lt;/b&gt; rows flow through flagged.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Default &lt;tt&gt;quarantine.include_warnings: false&lt;/tt&gt; keeps quarantine == exactly the dropped rows. With fan-in &lt;tt&gt;sources:&lt;/tt&gt; every flow feeds the same quarantine. Optional &lt;tt&gt;*_dq_metrics&lt;/tt&gt; MV. Locally dqx runs with a mocked WorkspaceClient and static run_time / run_id overwrites (removing them breaks MV incrementalization)." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="150" width="1620" x="40" y="436" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p3_cdc_hdr" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#82B366;strokeColor=#82B366;fontColor=#FFFFFF;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=14;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;" value="AUTO CDC  —  upserts without MERGE (the engine owns the merge)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="32" width="1620" x="40" y="610" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p3_cdc" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#82B366;strokeWidth=2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=14;fontSize=11;arcSize=2;" value="&lt;tt&gt;target.cdc&lt;/tt&gt; → &lt;tt&gt;create_streaming_table&lt;/tt&gt; + &lt;tt&gt;create_auto_cdc_flow(target=..., source=..., keys=[...], sequence_by=...)&lt;/tt&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;tt&gt;target.cdc_from_snapshot&lt;/tt&gt; → &lt;tt&gt;create_auto_cdc_from_snapshot_flow&lt;/tt&gt; for periodic full snapshots.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Flow names are checkpoint identities — renaming a fan-in / backfill flow (or converting single-source ↔ fan-in) abandons state and reprocesses from scratch; pair such a change with a deliberate full refresh. Streaming FROM a CDC/SCD table needs &lt;tt&gt;options: {skipChangeCommits: true}&lt;/tt&gt;." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="150" width="1620" x="40" y="646" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p3_e1" edge="1" parent="1" source="p3_models" target="p3_loader" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;strokeColor=#5D3879;strokeWidth=2;">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p3_e2" edge="1" parent="1" source="p3_loader" target="p3_gen" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;strokeColor=#5D3879;strokeWidth=2;">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p3_e3" edge="1" parent="1" source="p3_gen" target="p3_datasets" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;strokeColor=#5D3879;strokeWidth=2;">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p3_e4" edge="1" parent="1" source="p3_profile" target="p3_gen" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;dashed=1;strokeColor=#117A8B;strokeWidth=2;">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p3_footer" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#5D3879;" value="Any change under src/datalab/framework/ updates docs/FRAMEWORK.md in the same commit; if the models changed, run make schema and commit the regenerated schemas/*.json." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="1620" x="40" y="820" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
  <diagram name="4 - RUN - Medallion + profiles" id="dl_p4">
    <mxGraphModel grid="0" page="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1700" pageHeight="960" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="p4_title" parent="1" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=#1F4E79;fontColor=#FFFFFF;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;fontSize=18;fontStyle=1;" value="STAGE 3 of 4  —  RUN  ·  the medallion at runtime + the three execution profiles" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="40" width="1620" x="40" y="20" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p4_sub" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fontStyle=2;" value="The customer_sales_etl pipeline runs serverless on Databricks (environment_version 4). The same artifacts also run off-Databricks for a fast inner loop — with deliberate fidelity gaps noted below." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="34" width="1620" x="40" y="65" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p4_land" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#DAE8FC;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;strokeWidth=2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=8;fontSize=11;arcSize=3;" value="&lt;b&gt;Landing volume&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;/Volumes/&amp;lt;catalog&amp;gt;/landing/sales/customers/&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Raw JSON files arrive out-of-band; Auto Loader source." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="160" width="250" x="40" y="150" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p4_bronze" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FDE9D9;strokeColor=#D79B00;strokeWidth=2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=8;fontSize=11;arcSize=3;" value="&lt;b&gt;bronze.customers_raw&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;@dp.table (streaming) via cloud_files.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Raw ingest, minimal shaping." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="160" width="250" x="320" y="150" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p4_silver" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#DCDCF0;strokeColor=#36b;strokeWidth=2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=8;fontSize=11;arcSize=3;" value="&lt;b&gt;silver.customers&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;create_streaming_table + create_auto_cdc_flow (SCD1).&lt;br&gt;dqx gate keeps valid rows.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Upserts without MERGE.&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="160" width="280" x="600" y="150" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p4_gold" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;strokeWidth=2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=8;fontSize=11;arcSize=3;" value="&lt;b&gt;gold.customer_metrics&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;@dp.materialized_view.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Business-level aggregates for readers / BI / exports." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="160" width="250" x="910" y="150" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p4_refresh" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#D1ECF1;strokeColor=#117A8B;strokeWidth=2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=8;fontSize=11;arcSize=3;" value="&lt;b&gt;customer_sales_etl_refresh&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;pipeline_task, daily trigger (paused in dev).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Edge jobs read gold; notebook triages quarantine." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="160" width="250" x="1200" y="150" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p4_quar" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F8CECC;strokeColor=#B85450;strokeWidth=2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=8;fontSize=11;arcSize=3;" value="&lt;b&gt;silver.customers_quarantine&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;dqx error rows + _errors evidence — the dropped rows, exactly." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="110" width="280" x="600" y="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p4_e1" edge="1" parent="1" source="p4_land" target="p4_bronze" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;strokeColor=#388E3C;strokeWidth=2;" value="Auto Loader">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p4_e2" edge="1" parent="1" source="p4_bronze" target="p4_silver" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;strokeColor=#388E3C;strokeWidth=2;" value="AUTO CDC">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p4_e3" edge="1" parent="1" source="p4_silver" target="p4_gold" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;strokeColor=#388E3C;strokeWidth=2;" value="aggregate">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p4_e4" edge="1" parent="1" source="p4_silver" target="p4_quar" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;strokeColor=#B85450;strokeWidth=2;" value="error rows">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p4_matrix_hdr" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#1F4E79;strokeColor=#1F4E79;fontColor=#FFFFFF;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=14;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;" value="Execution profiles  —  capability fidelity (datalab.profile)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="32" width="1620" x="40" y="510" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p4_prof_db" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#82B366;strokeWidth=2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=10;fontSize=11;arcSize=3;" value="&lt;b&gt;databricks (default)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;deploy + run (make deploy / run).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Auto Loader ✓&lt;br&gt;• AUTO CDC ✓&lt;br&gt;• dqx quarantine ✓&lt;br&gt;• delta/kafka sinks ✓&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Full fidelity — the production path.&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="240" width="510" x="40" y="552" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p4_prof_local" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;strokeWidth=2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=10;fontSize=11;arcSize=3;" value="&lt;b&gt;local — OSS spark-pipelines&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;make run-local (generates spark-pipeline.yml).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Materializes bronze → silver → gold as BATCH MVs on sample data&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;No&lt;/b&gt; AUTO CDC dedup (a window over an in-graph dataset fails graph registration)&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;No&lt;/b&gt; dqx gate (dqx reads df.columns / df.isStreaming — forbidden in an SDP query fn)&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;No&lt;/b&gt; Auto Loader / sinks&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Validates mapping + transform shape only.&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="240" width="510" x="595" y="552" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p4_prof_conn" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#DAE8FC;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;strokeWidth=2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=10;fontSize=11;arcSize=3;" value="&lt;b&gt;connect — Databricks Connect&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;make validate-connect.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Runs run_dataset on a LIVE cluster from an isolated, out-of-lock overlay&lt;br&gt;• Validates transforms + dqx against real UC data&lt;br&gt;• Never installed into the dev venv / uv.lock (conflicts with pyspark)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;CDC / once semantics still verify via a dev refresh.&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="240" width="510" x="1150" y="552" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p4_footer" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1F4E79;" value="Local OSS pyspark.pipelines lacks Databricks-only symbols (AUTO CDC fns, once, MV refresh_policy); compat.py drops the knobs locally for shape-only inspection. CDC / dqx semantics verify on a dev refresh." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="1620" x="40" y="810" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
  <diagram name="5 - SHIP - Deploy + governance" id="dl_p5">
    <mxGraphModel grid="0" page="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1700" pageHeight="800" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="p5_title" parent="1" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=#2E7034;fontColor=#FFFFFF;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;fontSize=18;fontStyle=1;" value="STAGE 4 of 4  —  SHIP  ·  Declarative Automation Bundle, GitHub OIDC CI/CD, RBAC + ABAC" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="40" width="1620" x="40" y="20" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p5_sub" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fontStyle=2;" value="One bundle (databricks.yml + resources/*.yml) deploys the whole domain to dev / stage / prod. CD authenticates with GitHub OIDC — no long-lived Databricks secret in GitHub. Access governance has three layers, each with one home." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="34" width="1620" x="40" y="65" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p5_dab" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#82B366;strokeWidth=2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=12;spacingRight=14;fontSize=11;arcSize=3;" value="&lt;b style=&#39;font-size:13px;&#39;&gt;Declarative Automation Bundle&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;tt&gt;databricks.yml&lt;/tt&gt; — variables (catalog / schemas / paths)&lt;br&gt;• &lt;tt&gt;rbac.yml&lt;/tt&gt; — RBAC: group + permission-level string vars + complex pipeline_permissions / job_permissions (per-target overrides)&lt;br&gt;• &lt;tt&gt;resources/*.yml&lt;/tt&gt; — 1 SDP pipeline + 3 jobs (refresh / export / quarantine-report)&lt;br&gt;• targets: &lt;b&gt;dev&lt;/b&gt; (mode development — [dev user] prefix, trigger paused) · &lt;b&gt;stage&lt;/b&gt; · &lt;b&gt;prod&lt;/b&gt; (mode production, explicit root_path)&lt;br&gt;• deps delivered by &lt;tt&gt;--editable ${workspace.file_path}&lt;/tt&gt; (uv)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;make validate before pushing bundle changes.&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="250" width="790" x="40" y="150" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p5_cicd" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#D1ECF1;strokeColor=#117A8B;strokeWidth=2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=12;spacingRight=14;fontSize=11;arcSize=3;" value="&lt;b style=&#39;font-size:13px;&#39;&gt;GitHub OIDC CI/CD&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;CI&lt;/b&gt; (common-ci-steps): ruff + validate-configs + pytest (local Spark) + bundle validate, plus an advisory spark-pipelines dry-run&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;CD&lt;/b&gt; (common-cd-steps → deploy-dab): validate + deploy with optional --var overrides&lt;br&gt;• Auth = &lt;b&gt;GitHub OIDC&lt;/b&gt;; the federation subject must match &lt;tt&gt;repo:&amp;lt;owner&amp;gt;/&amp;lt;repo&amp;gt;:environment:&amp;lt;target&amp;gt;&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Releases: merge to main → dev · tag vX.Y.Z-rcN → stage · tag vX.Y.Z → prod&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Only STRING variables can be --var-overridden (complex cannot).&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="250" width="790" x="870" y="150" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p5_rbac" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFE6CC;strokeColor=#D79B00;strokeWidth=2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=12;fontSize=11;arcSize=3;" value="&lt;b&gt;Layer 1 · Workspace-resource RBAC&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;tt&gt;permissions:&lt;/tt&gt; on every bundle resource, driven by the group + permission-level string vars in &lt;tt&gt;rbac.yml&lt;/tt&gt; (the complex permissions reference them).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Both groups AND levels diverge per target (dev demo groups; stage / prod persona groups; prod tightens readers to CAN_VIEW + adds admin_group) and per GitHub Environment (DATALAB_*_GROUP → deploy-dab --var)." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="250" width="510" x="40" y="420" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p5_uc" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#DAE8FC;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;strokeWidth=2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=12;fontSize=11;arcSize=3;" value="&lt;b&gt;Layer 2 · Unity Catalog RBAC&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Grants-as-code in &lt;tt&gt;scripts/bootstrap_uc.py&lt;/tt&gt; — idempotent catalog / schema / volume DDL + GRANTs, applied once per target with &lt;tt&gt;make bootstrap-uc&lt;/tt&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliberately out-of-band of the bundle so &lt;tt&gt;bundle destroy&lt;/tt&gt; never touches governance state. Readers get silver/gold SELECT + export reads; engineers build the medallion." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="250" width="510" x="595" y="420" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p5_abac" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F8CECC;strokeColor=#B85450;strokeWidth=2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=12;fontSize=11;arcSize=3;" value="&lt;b&gt;Layer 3 · ABAC (display-only)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Column masks + row filters as SQL under the domain&#39;s &lt;tt&gt;sql/abac/&lt;/tt&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Nothing in this repo&lt;/b&gt; (CI, agents, scripts) executes them — an admin reviews and applies them manually.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Auto-applying access policy from a code repo is the failure mode this convention prevents.&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="250" width="510" x="1150" y="420" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p5_footer" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#2E7034;" value="Production-sensitive files (the bundle, dependency manifests, framework core, CI/CD, agent harness, docs-of-record) are guarded; the branch-first protocol (no edits on main) is enforced in both agent harnesses and the git pre-commit hook." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="1620" x="40" y="700" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
